    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present 15 Coolraine Estate, Mayorstone, Limerick. One of Limerick’s most established residential areas boasts extreme convenience without sacrificing space, both inside and out. \r\n\r\nExtending to a large and versatile living space, the ground floor features a south west facing living room, a guest bathroom with a shower, and a large, open plan kitchen / dining room. Upstairs, three further bedrooms and a large bathroom complete the living space.\r\n\r\n15 Coolraine Estate features an incredible back garden, with uninterrupted views to Thomond Park, and due to its strategic location, is not overlooked to the rear offering excellent sunlight throughout the day. To the side, a separate garage offers excellent opportunities for storage or extensions (S.P.P).\r\n\r\nA wide range of retail and service amenities are available nearby, including Jetland Shopping Centre, supermarkets, pharmacies, cafés and restaurants, while Limerick City Centre is only a short drive away. The property is also within convenient reach of the N18, N69 and M7 road networks, ensuring straightforward access to Shannon Airport, the Midwest region and further moterways. \r\n\r\nThis property is not subject to a rent cap - Built in 1962."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.67m x 2.41m\r\nLarge, bright entrance hall connecting to the living room, dining room and bathroom.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.06m x 3.71m\r\nFront facing living room with large windows and an open fireplace.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 8.51m x 3.30m\r\nAn excellent long dining room overlooking the back garden and with views to Thomond Park via the sliding glass doors, connecting though to the kitchen via sliding doors.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 6.93m x 2.37m\r\nFully fitted, convenient kitchen with views to the rear garden and door access to the side.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nLocated by the side access door in the kitchen allowing for excellent storage space.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom\r\nLarge fully fitted downstairs bathroom complete with decorative tiling throughout, W.C., W.H.B. and shower cubical.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 4.31m x 3.30m\r\nDouble bedroom complete with fitted wardrobes, views overlooking Thomond Park and access to the upstairs bathroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.07m x 3.30m\r\nDouble bedroom complete with fitted wardrobes and views to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.06m x 2.43m\r\n\r\nSingle bedroom with storage space and views to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.73m x 2.43m\r\nA fully fitted bathroom with decorative tiling throughout, W.C., H.W.B., Shower cubical & bath tub.\r\n\r\nGarden Space\r\nThe landscaped rear garden boast views over Thomond Park and benefits from not being overlooked. To the left of the property, a large garage adds extra storage space or the potential to extend the property (S.P.P.). The front garden is incredibly well landscaped with a large cobblelock driveway and mature shrubbery."
      },
